# recursive interpolation not allowed

Gawas isulat: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Programa bahin: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), bag-ong-linya.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Gawas isulat: a, bag-ong-linya.


